# Normalize line endings in the repository to LF, and check them out as LF on
# every platform. Without the eol=lf, Windows clones would get CRLF working
# copies and gofmt/diffs would churn between platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Go tooling is LF-only.
*.go text eol=lf
go.mod text eol=lf
go.sum text eol=lf
